{"id":"n6cf2bea12e","headline":"Oil Spill on D St: Jittery Indices Slip to 10 month Low","summary":"India's main equity indices fell to a 10-month low on Monday as oil prices rose past $100 a barrel for the first time since 2022. Concerns over inflation and the rupee deepened.","why":"India's benchmark indices track large listed companies on the National Stock Exchange and BSE. As a major oil importer, India is sensitive to crude prices, which affect inflation and the currency.","category":"markets","event_type":"commodity-prices","importance":3,"flag":null,"market_moving":true,"location":{"place":"Mumbai","country":"India","lat":19.08,"lon":72.88,"region":"asia"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"The Economic Times","url":"https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/epaper/delhicapital/2026/mar/10/et-front/oil-spill-on-d-st/articleshow/129357913.cms"},"sources":[{"name":"The Economic Times","url":"https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/epaper/delhicapital/2026/mar/10/et-front/oil-spill-on-d-st/articleshow/129357913.cms"}],"published_at":"2026-03-09T21:48:00Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-17T18:46:37Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"70de5c8796bb21bd","impacts":[],"why_moved":"Oil prices rose above $100 a barrel amid the West Asia conflict, raising concerns about inflation and energy costs for oil-importing India.","backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-17T18:46:37Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-03-09T21:48:00Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-03-10T06:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"JA","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/stock-market-trading-screen-5782411.jpg","alt":"stock market trading screen (illustration)","credit":"TheInvestorPost","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https: